{"type":"FeatureCollection","locode":"ECGYE","quays":[],"attribution":"© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright","position_outside":"UN/LOCODE places Guayaquil on the city centre (-2.1667, -79.9), about 9 km north of the nearest terminal. A ship there would be on the Guayas river at the city's waterfront, not at a cargo quay.","selection_digest":"8a2c989c0d0571737b51d6634c50e19d56db4d5ecdae04b409d22e82e08ab74a","features":[
{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["way/1054844869","way/1006788251","way/1006774974","way/1006773727","way/1006773728","way/1006773726","way/1006774975","way/1006814725"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 300 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","disjoint":"Isla Trinitaria lies between the two main parts: Contecon and Fertisa are on the water east of the island, TPG and Naportec on the water west of it, and the two channels meet beyond these limits. The other two parts are TPG's container yards mapped as TPG INARPI 3 and 4, and TPG INARPI 5, 30 to 90 m back from the water on the island, which nothing OpenStreetMap maps joins to it.","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Guayaquil. These are the hull of the terminals below, from Contecon in the south to TPG in the north-west, grown by 300 m, cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the terminals kept whole and a 30 m margin where they meet the water. What is left is the four terminals and the Estero Salado and its channels alongside. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no schools, hospitals or places of worship inside. The edges of five houses, about 30 m² in all, and of three residential areas behind the public port (Fertisa, Antártida and Coop. Nuevo Ecuador 1) reach in by about 0.25 ha in all, none of it more than 40 m inside; the named places are labels on the terminals and the outline of Isla Trinitaria, under TPG and Naportec.","inside":{"houses":0,"residential_m2":2379,"residential":[{"osm":"way/752667032","name":"Antártida","m2":1253},{"osm":"way/750929932","name":"Fertisa","m2":618},{"osm":"way/752667030","name":"Coop. Nuevo Ecuador 1","m2":508}],"amenities":0,"places":[{"name":"Puerto Marítimo \"Libertador Simón Bolívar\"","place":"suburb","osm":"node/12512426065"},{"name":"Terminal Portuaria - Andipuerto","place":"suburb","osm":"node/12512426066"},{"name":"Terminal Portuaria Fertisa","place":"suburb","osm":"node/12512426067"},{"name":"Terminal Portuario BananaPuerto","place":"suburb","osm":"node/12512426069"},{"name":"Terminal Portuario Guayaquil - TPG","place":"suburb","osm":"node/12512426070"}]}},"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-79.9113,-2.276717],[-79.910321,-2.275731],[-79.910271,-2.275443],[-79.910473,-2.275558],[-79.911117,-2.276525],[-79.911318,-2.276401],[-79.910518,-2.275547],[-79.910664,-2.275554],[-79.911288,-2.276178],[-79.911554,-2.276221],[-79.911778,-2.276195],[-79.911911,-2.275812],[-79.912081,-2.275931],[-79.91237,-2.275792],[-79.912885,-2.275929],[-79.913572,-2.275835],[-79.913803,-2.275621],[-79.91388,-2.274823],[-79.913486,-2.272748],[-79.913048,-2.272482],[-79.913138,-2.272095],[-79.912773,-2.270689],[-79.912542,-2.270569],[-79.912542,-2.270218],[-79.912121,-2.26924],[-79.912452,-2.269402],[-79.911915,-2.267302],[-79.911675,-2.266924],[-79.911082,-2.267019],[-79.910542,-2.266864],[-79.90928,-2.267302],[-79.909125,-2.267224],[-79.909271,-2.26695],[-79.910065,-2.266496],[-79.910838,-2.266616],[-79.911687,-2.266355],[-79.911327,-2.262856],[-79.910469,-2.261081],[-79.910359,-2.261025],[-79.909666,-2.261801],[-79.908323,-2.263552],[-79.907328,-2.26441],[-79.906479,-2.264861],[-79.906355,-2.265258],[-79.905136,-2.265246],[-79.904791,-2.264649],[-79.90517,-2.264072],[-79.905594,-2.263926],[-79.90685,-2.263144],[-79.906941,-2.262825],[-79.907495,-2.262647],[-79.908006,-2.262063],[-79.907944,-2.261536],[-79.908419,-2.260661],[-79.908338,-2.260356],[-79.907964,-2.260261],[-79.907768,-2.260406],[-79.907718,-2.260222],[-79.907476,-2.260157],[-79.906386,-2.260756],[-79.905691,-2.260817],[-79.905798,-2.261227],[-79.90556,-2.261124],[-79.905364,-2.260429],[-79.905146,-2.260372],[-79.904719,-2.260502],[-79.905326,-2.260111],[-79.905796,-2.26052],[-79.906296,-2.260431],[-79.